   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Play A Train Song**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **The Fire On My Tounge**: back after 101 archived shows (778 days); rare: 4 archived performances [2]\n- **Midnight Train**: rare: 3 archived performances [2]\n- **Catch A Release**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Georgie Buck**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Im A Natural Born Gambling Man**: rare: 3 archived performances [2]\n- **Charlie's Birthday Breakdown**: rare: 12 archived performances [2]\n- **Pancho & Lefty**: back after 124 archived shows (897 days); rare: 5 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2025-11-15** (recommended): source not stated; 24 songs; 147 min [1]. Said about its sound: Uploader says the recording came out well because the nearby audience members were very quiet [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2025-11-15**: taped by Marc Geanoules; transferred by Marc Geanoules; source: DAUD Section 22 Row 8 [1]. Also: Recorded from Section 22, Row 8; the uploader did nothing to the recording except track it [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by Blaxteeco: [Billy Strings Newark New Jersey 2025 Night 2 Venue Poster At Prudential Center On November 15 2025 Repairer Art Home Dec](https://blaxteeco.com/product/billy-strings-newark-new-jersey-2025-night-2-venue-poster-at-prudential-center-on-november-15-2025-repairer-art-home-decor-poster-canvas/) [3]",
